<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia skilled vacancies up in March - govt.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia skilled vacancies up in March - govt.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian government's skilled vacancies index rose 2.0 percent in March from February and was unchanged from March 1996, the Employment Department said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
